              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua Ahaba mei au, wakadihanda bilulu biandi, wakaluata bilulu bikayabala hamʼbidi nʼandi, wakajila bia kudia, wakalala mu bilulu bikayabala, wakenda bitulu bitalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
